{"id":"621712","name":"凉拌秋葵虾仁","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/621712/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"秋葵","amount":"10根"},{"name":"虾仁","amount":"10-15个"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜","amount":"2瓣"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"秋葵和虾仁。","img":"images/621712/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"开水把秋葵煮熟。","img":"images/621712/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"烫熟虾仁。","img":"images/621712/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"秋葵煮熟后泡一下凉水。","img":"images/621712/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"虾仁烫熟后泡一下凉水。","img":"images/621712/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"秋葵切去头尾，切段。","img":"images/621712/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"秋葵和虾仁放入碗中。","img":"images/621712/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"蒜切末，葱和小米辣切小段。","img":"images/621712/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"起锅热油。","img":"images/621712/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"炒熟蒜末，和葱辣椒末。","img":"images/621712/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加一勺酱油。","img":"images/621712/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加一碗水。","img":"images/621712/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加一勺醋。","img":"images/621712/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"调料汁倒入秋葵虾仁。","img":"images/621712/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"撒一点点盐。","img":"images/621712/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/621712/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}